find out about special  information about the episode and like I  said in the beginning I mean I think  it's a really good episode it's just not  quite as good as the pilot it goes in a  different direction which it needs to do  and there's really nothing wrong about  it I mean I like that I like the Cooper  that we meet here I like how that  develops the major garland brig stuff is  interesting when you rewatch you know  you really see how they pepper these  characters in there and how they're  important right from the beginning but  you're so focused in on Laura herself  and the characters that were closest to  her that you kind of overlook them  obviously like I mentioned the scene  where Sarah Palmer and Donna are  together is a highlight also Donna's  scene with her own mother is very  interesting mark frost dad Warren Frost  had a great performance there in the  scene where he's talking about the post  mortem and we get to know everybody a  little bit better  thought it was pretty good but I'm  interested to see what you guys think  it's kind of hard to say objectively  when I have such favorite episodes that  I know that are coming up and whatnot so  on a rewatch I'd say it's good not the  best but definitely in the upper echelon  of episodes let me know what you guys  think I should have a new video in this  series next week so let me know how  you'd like to see things go I have been  toying with the idea of doing a live  stream maybe doing that like in a Q&amp;A so  we can discuss the episode together so  give me a chime in on that as well  please like the video if you enjoyed it  if you'd like to try to win the final  dossier by mark frost which comes out  October 31st follow the link to my  patreon account and read all about the  giveaway there you can also get involved  with helping to keep this video series  alive I want to thank everyone who has  gone there and signed up I really  appreciate it I'm enjoying making this  series and it's all because of you guys  make sure you subscribe to my channel  turn on notifications after that follow  me on my social media accounts and  thanks for watching guys I'll talk to  you soon
 

